  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Strengthen the Management of ASSE</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Fortalecimiento de la gestin de ASSE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir a mejorar la efectividad y eficiencia de la produccin de los servicios pblicos de salud del Uruguay. Especficamente, el programa se propone coadyuvar a la produccin y utilizacin de informacin oportuna, confiable y homognea para la toma de decisiones por parte de las unidades asistenciales y ejecutoras de ASSE, as como de su nivel central, Ministerio de Economa y Finanzas (MEF) y Ministerio de Salud Pblica (MSP)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the program is to help make the production of public health services in Uruguay more effective and efficient. Specifically, the program would support the production and use of timely, reliable, and homogeneous information for decision-making by the healthcare and executing units of the Government Health Services Administration (ASSE), as well as the ASSE&apos;s central administration, the Ministry of Economy and Finance, and the Ministry of Public Health.</narrative>
  </description>
